  "note": "Election of the Enniskillen Urban Council, ordinary day 15 May 1939; only the requisite number were nominated, so there were no contests and the new Council was returned unopposed (Fermanagh Herald, 20 May 1939, p. 5, 'Unopposed returns for Enniskillen Council'). Returned unopposed. Devine and Patterson were new members. Citation unconfirmed: the names were not all found on the cited page (verification 5 Nov 2026). Returned unopposed."
